  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: $\\operatorname{Lt}_{x \\rightarrow 5} \\frac{x f(5)-\\operatorname{tf}(x)}{x-5}=\\operatorname{Lt}_{x \\rightarrow 5} \\frac{f(5)-5 f^{\\prime}(x)}{1}=f(5)-5 f^{\\prime}(5)=7-5 \\times 7=-28$"
